  m_text: "<b>HOW TO MAKE A DRINK</b>\n1. Read a ticket\n2. Pour into <b>Stir Cup</b>
    or <b>Shake Mixer</b>\n3. Same density: <b>stir</b>. Different: <b>shake</b>\n4.
    <b>Mixed</b>: Shake Mixer into the glass\n    <b>Layered</b>: Stir Cup, one tip
    per layer\n5. Ice: Cold. Fruit on the rim: colour\n6. Glass on the coaster, ring
    the bell\n<color=#ff7a7a>Red button: everything back in place</color>"
